### Ship Arrival/Departure API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/ship-arrivals-departures
@shipTrackingId = SHIP_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@trackingId = RECORD_TRACKING_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new arrival/departure record
POST {{baseUrl}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commercialShipTrackingId": "{{shipTrackingId}}",
  "movementType": "ARRIVAL",
  "arrivalDate": "2024-11-15T08:00:00",
  "departureDate": null,
  "portOfOrigin": "COTONOU",
  "nextDestination": "LOME",
  "berthNumber": "B-12",
  "purpose": "CARGO_UNLOADING"
}

### 2. Update arrival/departure record (Path Variable)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/update/{{trackingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commercialShipTrackingId": "{{shipTrackingId}}",
  "movementType": "DEPARTURE",
  "arrivalDate": "2024-11-15T08:00:00",
  "departureDate": "2024-11-17T14:00:00",
  "portOfOrigin": "COTONOU",
  "nextDestination": "ABIDJAN",
  "berthNumber": "B-12",
  "purpose": "CARGO_UNLOADING"
}

### 3. Get specific record (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/{{trackingId}}

### 4. Get all records for a ship (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/commercial-ship/{{shipTrackingId}}

### 5. Get ships currently in port
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/currently-in-port

### 6. Get arrivals by period (Path Variables - NEW FORMAT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/arrivals/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 7. Get departures by period (Path Variables - NEW FORMAT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/departures/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 8. Get by port of origin (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/port-of-origin/COTONOU

### 9. Get by next destination (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/next-destination/ABIDJAN

### 10. Get all records
GET {{baseUrl}}/list

### 11. Delete record (Path Variable)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete/{{trackingId}}
